      "id": "llir",
      "label": "LLVM IR",
      "content": "; Illustrative lowering — not a hardware compilation\ndefine void @vector_add(ptr %X, ptr %Y, ptr %Z) {\nentry:\n  %pid = call i32 @tx81.program_id(i32 0)\n  %base = mul i32 %pid, 256\n  %mask = icmp slt i32 %base, 1024\n  %xp = getelementptr float, ptr %X, i32 %base\n  %x = load <256 x float>, ptr %xp\n  %yp = getelementptr float, ptr %Y, i32 %base\n  %y = load <256 x float>, ptr %yp\n  %z = fadd <256 x float> %x, %y\n  %zp = getelementptr float, ptr %Z, i32 %base\n  store <256 x float> %z, ptr %zp\n  ret void\n}",
